" wanderlan  1 Overview  2 Sites  3 VLANs  4 MAC table  5 Log  6 Setup           "
"┌ Setup: Welcome ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ wanderlan stretches VLANs across sites on layer 2. It does not build a VPN:  │"
"│ the sites must already reach each other through an existing transport        │"
"│ network (usually a VPN), and every site has an address in it.                │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ This wizard creates a minimal configuration: this site and one peer that     │"
"│ already runs wanderlan. The full mesh configuration then arrives             │"
"│ automatically from that peer as soon as the peer lists this site.            │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ Press Enter to start, Esc to leave the setup.                                │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
